    <description>P11 | A11-05, A11-11, A11-06 | Before save on a GoMeddo room reservation. Entry: on create, when a flag is set or the status rule can apply; on update, only when a flag is set and a flag or the room changed. A11-06 (create and update): clears Need Refreshments / Need Arrangement when the room does not support them. A11-05 and A11-11 (create only, internal users, room reservations whose status is blank, approved or pending, not a private closing and not a sub-room copy): pending when the room needs approval, or when there is no order (none on the reservation or its parent) and the user lacks Reserve_Without_Approval; otherwise approved. The room flag wins over the permission (Lior 18.11.2026). Portal users and P11_Data_Load_Bypass are untouched. Separate from Tal&apos;s Reservation_Assign_Buffers (after save), which it does not change.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>ApplyStatusRule</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>ISNEW()
&amp;&amp; NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.B25__Resource__c}))
&amp;&amp; ISBLANK({!$Record.Split_Parent__c})
&amp;&amp; TEXT({!$User.UserType}) = &quot;Standard&quot;
&amp;&amp; NOT({!$Permission.P11_Data_Load_Bypass})
&amp;&amp; TEXT({!$Record.Booking_Kind__c}) &lt;&gt; &quot;סגירה לפעילות פרטית&quot;
&amp;&amp; (ISBLANK({!$Record.B25__Status__c}) || {!$Record.B25__Status__r.Name} = &quot;אושרה&quot; || {!$Record.B25__Status__r.Name} = &quot;מחכה לאישור&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>ClearArrangement</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Need_Arrangement__c} &amp;&amp; NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.B25__Resource__c})) &amp;&amp; NOT({!$Record.B25__Resource__r.Modify_Arrangement_Available__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>ClearRefreshments</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Need_Refreshments__c} &amp;&amp; NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.B25__Resource__c})) &amp;&amp; NOT({!$Record.B25__Resource__r.Can_Have_Refreshments__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>TargetStatusName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
  {!$Record.B25__Resource__r.Need_Confirmed__c}
  || (ISBLANK({!$Record.B25__Opportunity__c}) &amp;&amp; ISBLANK({!$Record.B25__Parent_Reservation__r.B25__Opportunity__c}) &amp;&amp; NOT({!$Permission.Reserve_Without_Approval})),
  &quot;מחכה לאישור&quot;,
  &quot;אושרה&quot;
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>P11 Reservation Before Save {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>P11 שיבוץ חדר - לפני שמירה</label>
